    {
      "target": "민준 씨 말이 논리적이라서 설득됐어요.",
      "reading": "minjun ssi mari nonrijeogiraseo seoldeukdwaesseoyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "Minjun's words were logical, so I was convinced.",
